# Same conventions as pats_syntax.spec: [record R (f: T, ..)] is an ATS1 record '{f= T, ..} (R_new, x.f()),
# [type N] is a datatype (N_CON(..), N_view for pattern matching), List/Option are glist/gopt.
# [labs1exp] is the ATS1 one-constructor datatype [sl0abeled (s1exp)] (SL0ABELED (l, name, s1e)) made a record,
# like [labs0exp] of pats_syntax.spec. D1Cextype of 3 arguments is renamed D1Cextype2 (pats_dynexp1.spec).
# [v1al] has a double: --compact stores a double field by value (utils/arenagen/arenagen.py DWORD).
